  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Murdertalon Raiders",
    "summary": "For your **HERETIC ASTARTES INFANTRY FLY** units:\n\n- their attacks against a unit that is **battle-shocked** or down to **Half-strength** or less can re-roll 1s to Hit\n- attacks against them by an enemy unit that is **battle-shocked** or down to **Half-strength** or less get -1 to Hit\n\nThis detachment carries the **NIGHTMARE** tag; you cannot take it alongside another **NIGHTMARE** detachment.",
